                    'languages_id' => '1',
                    'title' => 'Why study English at MLI?',
                    'text' => 'This week’s featured student is Mohammed from Saudi Arabia. He currently studies in our Intermediate 1 ESL program. He has been visiting Los Angeles every summer in July since 2014 and absolutely loves everything about Los Angeles. He enjoys doing many things, particularly acting. He recently signed up for surfing school here in Los Angeles to learn surfing for the first time- so he hopes surfing will become one of his hobbies soon! His favorite places in Los Angeles include all the beaches- Santa Monica, Venice, and his absolute favorite- Malibu.

                    “I really recommend studying English in Los Angeles at Mentor Language School. This school is a very good ESL school. It’s in a good area, Westwood, which is near a popular university (UCLA). I feel like this area is in some ways similar to my home country, Saudi Arabia. MLI is such a good school because of all the school staff! Lindsay (the Program Coordinator) and Rafa (the Office Manager) are such good managers and are the best part of the school. They are so nice and helpful always for all the students. I like everything about this school- it’s very good. I recommend that students come and plan to study hard and learn a lot. You can learn from many different international students here too, like students from Japan and Spain. Los Angeles is great too because I love acting and do a lot of acting back in Saudi Arabia, but my future dreams are to become an actor here in Los Angeles. There are so many actors around and lots of opportunities for that. I think this is the best school and that students should definitely study here in Los Angeles!”',
