                    'title' => '在洛杉磯學習ESL是什麼感覺',
                    'text' => 'MLI Westwood特色學生

                    本週的特色學生是來自巴西的辛迪。在巴西，她擔任室內設計師，併計劃在洛杉磯的一所大學學習建築學。她現在在洛杉磯住了5個月，非常喜歡去這裡的海灘和俱樂部。
                    
                    “我在洛杉磯學習英語已有5個月了。當我第一次來到MLI時，我很驚訝，因為這裡的學生非常認真。我曾經去過不同的ESL學校，但我認為MLI很好學習英語，因為所有學生都非常認真地學習英語。我住在卡爾弗城，我絕對推薦給學生，特別是巴西人，因為有很多巴西人住在那裡，所以很有趣。我還認為韋斯特伍德（校園所在地）是一個適合居住的好地方，因為它靠近學校，而且地理位置優越。在洛杉磯，有很多事情要做。我喜歡去海灘 - 威尼斯是我最喜歡的一個。我也喜歡去俱樂部，因為我喜歡跳舞。我現在在這裡有很多國際友人，所以我喜歡和他們一起出去玩。通常在下課後，我經常去海灘，去健身房，和朋友一起吃晚餐。我也非常喜歡洛杉磯的遊樂園 - 環球影城和六旗都很酷。也有很多派對讓學生參與和見面。我絕對推薦其他學生在洛杉磯學習。洛杉磯不是一個便宜的地方，但我認為它比巴西好。我非常喜歡這裡！我甚至得到了洛杉磯的紋身，因為我覺得我屬於這裡，希望我能永遠住在這裡。它真的是一個如此美麗的地方。它有很大的共鳴，學校裡的人很棒，天氣也很好。我絕對推薦學生在洛杉磯學習英語。“' 
                ],
                [
                    'testimonials_id' => 16,
                    'languages_id' => '12',
                    'title' => 'What it\'s like to study ESL in Los Angeles',
                    'text' => 'MLI Westwood Featured Student

                    This week’s featured student is Cindy from Brazil. In Brazil, she works as an interior designer and plans to study Architecture at a university here in Los Angeles. She has lived in Los Angeles for 5 months now and really enjoys going to the beaches and clubs here.
                    
                    “I’ve been studying English in Los Angeles for about 5 months now. When I first came to MLI, I was surprised because the students here are so serious. I used to go to a different ESL school, but I think MLI is good to learn English because all the students are very serious about learning English. I live in Culver City and I definitely recommend it to students, especially Brazilians, because there are many Brazilians who live there, so it is fun. I also think Westwood [where the campus is located] is a good place to live too because it’s near the school and it’s a good location. In LA, there is so much to do. I love going to the beaches- Venice is my favorite one. I also love going to clubs, because I love dancing. I have many international friends here now, so I love to hang out with them. Typically after class, I often go to the beach, to the gym, to dinner with friends. I also really like the amusement parks in Los Angeles- Universal Studios and Six Flags are cool. There are also many parties for students to get involved in and meet people. I definitely recommend other students to study in Los Angeles. LA is not a cheap place, but I think it’s better than Brazil. I love it here so much! I even got a tattoo of Los Angeles because I feel like I belong here and wish I could live here forever. It really is such a beautiful place. It has great vibes, wonderful people at school, and nice weather. I definitely recommend students to come study English in Los Angeles.”' 
                ],
