                [
                    'testimonials_id' => 36,
                    'languages_id' => '10',
                    'title' => 'Name: Vanesa',
                    'text' => '西木區校園特色學生
                    名稱：Vanesa
                    國籍：玻利維亞
                    你在哪個班級？
                    我在一般英文中級課程，還參加了CMAR課程來幫助我的發音。
                    你是如何選擇MLI的？
                    我想去洛杉磯學習，因為加利福尼亞太美了，天氣也很好。我在很多學校上網查看，認為MLI的地理位置非常好，而且價格非常便利。
                    你認為什麼是洛杉磯最好的地方？
                    我喜歡去海邊 - 我喜歡馬里布。我也喜歡洛杉磯的博物館，特別是LACMA。它有許多不同的東西，像藝術品，衣服，家具，繪畫......它非常巨大。有很多好去處，洛杉磯是一個很大的地方。
                    你覺得自從搬到這里以後你的成長情況如何？
                    我想我總是對其他文化非常了解。我已經成為一個更強壯的人。我也可以說我的英語變得更好了。當我傾聽時，我說得更多，理解更多。當我剛到這裡時，我認為我的英語非常糟糕，我說得不好，但現在我好多了。我每天都在學習更多。
                    你典型的一周是什麼樣的？
                    我周一至週五早上去學校，然後通常在放學後去健身房。我通常每週都去探索新的地方;洛杉磯如此之大，總有新的東西可以看到。我也喜歡騎我的自行車。我住在聖莫尼卡，這是一個美麗的地方生活，並且總是有很多事情要做。
                    對於考慮遷往洛杉磯的學生，您有任何提示嗎？
                    在MLI學習的提示 - 你需要每天上課 - 重要的是不要忽略課程，因為我們每天都會學到新的東西。來洛杉磯的提示 - 天氣總是很完美，所以要花時間享受它。此外，洛杉磯的人真的很好，所以交朋友和玩樂。'
                ],   
                [
                    'testimonials_id' => 36,
                    'languages_id' => '12',
                    'title' => 'The people in LA are really nice, so make friends and have fun.(Vanesa | Bolivian)',
                    'text' => 'What class are you in?
                    - I’m in the ESL program and also take CMAR class to help my pronunciation.
                    
                    How did you choose MLI?
                    - I wanted to study in Los Angeles because California is so beautiful and the weather is good. I looked online at a lot of schools and thought MLI had such a great location and the price was very accessible.
                    
                    What do you think are some of the best places to go in LA?
                    - I enjoy going to the beach- I love Malibu. I also like the museums in Los Angeles, especially LACMA. It has so many different things to see like art, clothes, furniture, paintings.. It’s so huge. There are a lot of good places to go here, LA is a big place.
                    
                    How do you think you have grown since moving here?
                    - I think I’m always learning so much about other cultures. I have definitely become a stronger person. I also can tell that my English is getting a lot better. I am speaking a lot more and understand more when I listen. When I first arrived here, I think my English was really bad, I couldn’t speak well, but now I’m so much better. I am learning more every day.
                    
                    What is your typical week like?
                    - I go to school Monday-Friday morning and then usually go to the gym after school. I usually go every week to explore new places; LA is so huge there are always new things you can see. I like to ride my bike too. I live in Santa Monica, which is a beautiful place to live and always has a lot to do.
                    
                    Do you have any tips for students considering moving to LA?
                    - Tips for studying at MLI- You need to come to class every day- it’s important to never skip class because we learn something new every day. Tips for coming to LA- The weather is always perfect, so take time to enjoy it. Also, the people in LA are really nice, so make friends and have fun.'
                ],   
